+## Revision 32
+
+One daily 3D subject replaces the calendar rings and side ornaments. Explicit city/place search supplies weather, humidity and sunrise/sunset. Country holiday templates cover 250 countries/territories with future-data limitations. IP location remains an estimate. [Details](history/32차/README.md) · [Changes](변경기록_32차.md)
+
+A Windows desktop app with the original date-based 3D calendar themes enabled by default. The observatory remains available as an explicit choice. Model-change notifications, account rate-limit percentages, time and weather are preserved.
+
